# Oko, Lorwyn Liege and Oko, Shadowmoor Scion: "At the beginning of your first main phase, you may pay {G}. If you do,
# transform Oko." Turn 3 pays it with Mox Emerald, the +2 of turn 1 having raised the loyalty to 5, and "-3: Create two 3/3
# green Elk creature tokens" leaves 2 (a transformed permanent keeps its counters, CR 712.18). Turn 5 the back's own trigger
# is declined ({U} could be paid), so Oko stays Shadowmoor Scion, and "-1: Mill three cards. You may put a permanent card
# from among them into your hand" mills three Lightning Bolts: none is a permanent card, so nothing is taken.

